    "detailed_description": "Robo Rush is a fast-paced, single-player, action platformer featuring one mode, one level, and one goal: Reach the end as fast as possible.  You will have to conquer a wide variety of platforming challenges:  Spike Avoiding, Platform Stepping, Missile Dodging, Button Pressing and Wall Grabbing! Robo Rush encourages quick reflexes and a dedication to the mastery of this course.  The controls are simple, and easy to use on both game pad or keyboard. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou also have the ability to reset your run at any moment. At the press of a button the stage resets, and you are sent back to the start, making testing new routes and strategies easy and approachable. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRobo Rush does not have difficulty settings, however finishing the game is approachable for a wide variety of skill levels.",
    "about_the_game": "Robo Rush is a fast-paced, single-player, action platformer featuring one mode, one level, and one goal: Reach the end as fast as possible.  You will have to conquer a wide variety of platforming challenges:  Spike Avoiding, Platform Stepping, Missile Dodging, Button Pressing and Wall Grabbing! Robo Rush encourages quick reflexes and a dedication to the mastery of this course.  The controls are simple, and easy to use on both game pad or keyboard. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou also have the ability to reset your run at any moment. At the press of a button the stage resets, and you are sent back to the start, making testing new routes and strategies easy and approachable. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRobo Rush does not have difficulty settings, however finishing the game is approachable for a wide variety of skill levels.",
